# Driver CSPACE layout that devmgr hand-mints today (docs/ccl-driver-manifests.md):
# 4..8 device resources and driver registration, 9 real-time scheduling,
# 15 the devmgr ready endpoint. Slot 62 is reserved for a driver's saved
# reply capability (intel-gpu buffer-object replies) and is never allocated
# or granted from a manifest. Binding data only; no policy approval is implied.
(service-catalog v1
  (application-slots 4 14)
  (service device-manager 7 read-write)
  (notification keyboard 1 publish-and-manage)
  (notification ata 2 publish-and-manage)
  (notification nvme 5 publish-and-manage)
  (notification hda 8 publish-and-manage)
  (notification mixer 9 publish-and-manage)
  (notification mouse 10 publish-and-manage)
  (fixed-binding scheduling 9)
  (fixed-binding ready 15))
